    {
      "example": "{\n  \"tableFlag\" : true,\n  \"scope\" : \"personal\",\n  \"personal\" : {\n    \"DataSourceType\" : \"remote_data_center\",\n    \"FileId\" : \"f-5qlrwaw10********s3gpw1z\",\n    \"Database\" : \"测试表格******.xlsx\",\n    \"Tables\" : [ \"Sheet1\" ],\n    \"TableIds\" : [ \"******\" ],\n    \"RegionId\" : \"cn-hangzhou\"\n  }\n}",
      "help_en": "The specified data scope in JSON character string format.\nCommon metric description\ntableFlag: true indicates that a data scope is specified.\nscope: personal is a fixed value.\npersonal: pass parameters for file or database types.\n\nFile type. Pass parameters in the following format:\nDataSourceType: remote_data_center is a fixed value.\nFileId: the file ID.\nDatabase: the database name returned by the ListDataCenterTable operation, which is typically the file name.\nTables: the table name returned by the ListDataCenterTable operation.\nTableIds: the TableId returned by the ListDataCenterTable operation.\nRegionId: the current region.\n```\n{\n  \"tableFlag\": true,\n  \"scope\": \"personal\",\n  \"personal\": {\n    \"DataSourceType\": \"remote_data_center\",\n    \"FileId\": \"f-f0jksn001ibmkoo********6v2zn6\",\n    \"Database\": \"diamonds.csv\",\n    \"Tables\": [\n      \"diamonds\"\n    ],\n    \"TableIds\": [\n      \"35hfn94pxl********50pi\"\n    ],\n    \"RegionId\": \"cn-hangzhou\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\nDatabase type. Pass parameters as follows:\nDataSourceType: database is a fixed value.\nDmsInstanceId: the DMS instance ID returned by the data center operation.\nDmsDatabaseId: the DMS database ID returned by the data center operation.\nFileId: the instance name (deprecated).\nDbName: the database name returned by the data center operation.\nDatabase: the database name returned by the data center operation.\nTables: the table name returned by the data center operation.\nTableIds: the TableId returned by the data center operation.\nEngine: the DPI engine type (mysql or postgresql).\nRegionId: the current region.\n```\n{\n  \"tableFlag\": true,\n  \"scope\": \"personal\",\n  \"personal\": {\n    \"DataSourceType\": \"database\",\n    \"DmsInstanceId\": \"284***8\",\n    \"DmsDatabaseId\": \"769***45\",\n    \"FileId\": \"pgm-bp15095e*******6t\",\n    \"DbName\": \"pg_catalog\",\n    \"Database\": \"pg_catalog\",\n    \"Tables\": [\n      \"pg_aggregate\"\n    ],\n    \"TableIds\": [\n      \"5263****31\"\n    ],\n    \"Engine\": \"postgresql\",\n    \"RegionId\": \"cn-hangzhou\"\n  }\n}\n```",
      "help_zh": "指定的数据范围，JSON字符串格式\n通用参数说明\ntableFlag：true为指定数据范围\nscope：personal为固定值\npersonal：文件、数据库类型的传参\n\n文件类型，按如下格式传参：\nDataSourceType：remote_data_center为固定值\nFileId：文件ID\nDatabase：ListDataCenterTable接口返回的库名，通常为文件名\nTables：ListDataCenterTable接口返回的表名\nTableIds：ListDataCenterTable接口返回的TableId\nRegionId：当前地域\n```\n{\n  \"tableFlag\": true,\n  \"scope\": \"personal\",\n  \"personal\": {\n    \"DataSourceType\": \"remote_data_center\",\n    \"FileId\": \"f-f0jksn001ibmkoo********6v2zn6\",\n    \"Database\": \"diamonds.csv\",\n    \"Tables\": [\n      \"diamonds\"\n    ],\n    \"TableIds\": [\n      \"35hfn94pxl********50pi\"\n    ],\n    \"RegionId\": \"cn-hangzhou\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n数据库类型，按如下参数传参：\nDataSourceType：database为固定值\nDmsInstanceId：数据中心接口返回的DMS实例ID\nDmsDatabaseId：数据中心接口返回的DMS数据库ID\nFileId：实例名（已废弃）\nDbName：数据中心接口返回的数据库名称\nDatabase：数据中心接口返回的数据库名称\nTables：数据中心接口返回的表名\nTableIds：数据中心接口返回的TableId\nEngine：引擎类型（mysql、postgresql）\nRegionId：当前地域\n```\n{\n  \"tableFlag\": true,\n  \"scope\": \"personal\",\n  \"personal\": {\n    \"DataSourceType\": \"database\",\n    \"DmsInstanceId\": \"284***8\",\n    \"DmsDatabaseId\": \"769***45\",\n    \"FileId\": \"pgm-bp15095e*******6t\",\n    \"DbName\": \"pg_catalog\",\n    \"Database\": \"pg_catalog\",\n    \"Tables\": [\n      \"pg_aggregate\"\n    ],\n    \"TableIds\": [\n      \"5263****31\"\n    ],\n    \"Engine\": \"postgresql\",\n    \"RegionId\": \"cn-hangzhou\"\n  }\n}\n```",
